@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontColor #243247
skinparam ArrowColor #53657A
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #E2EDFC
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DE
skinparam NoteBorderColor #BDAA65
hide footbox
title Selected-trip statistics: filter first, then total
participant "command: TripStatsCommand" as Cmd #E2EDFC
participant "ExpenseFilter\n(static)" as Filter #E3F3EF
participant "book: TripBook" as Book #E3F3EF
participant "expenses: ExpenseList" as Expenses #E3F3EF
participant "Statistics\n(static)" as Stats #E3F3EF
activate Cmd
Cmd -> Filter ++ : select(state, null, month, true)
Filter -> Book ++ : hasCurrent()
Book --> Filter -- : true
Filter -> Book ++ : getCurrent()
Book --> Filter -- : selected trip
note over Filter, Book
  Selection is resolved at execution time.
  No selection: throw TripJioException; the caller shows an error.
end note
Filter -> Expenses ++ : getExpensesBetween(start, end)
Expenses --> Filter -- : fresh list of original expenses
note right of Filter : Intersect with the optional month.\nBoth trip boundary dates are included.
Filter --> Cmd -- : filtered expenses
Cmd -> Stats ++ : getCategoryTotals(filtered expenses)
note right of Stats : Sum personal SGD amounts\nusing getAmount().
Stats --> Cmd -- : category totals
note over Cmd : Display the trip name, category totals and total spent.\nThe command remains read-only.
deactivate Cmd
note over Cmd, Stats
  Successful path shown; AppState/date/name getters and Ui calls are omitted.
  List and split-list commands reuse the filter but retain global indexes.
end note
@enduml
